     1,
     "Hi all,<div><br></div><div>Does anyone know how to remove the degree markers(the grey circle around pie) of the pie chart? </div><div>The code is like this: </div><div><div>ggplot(piedata, aes(x = &quot;&quot;, y = val, fill = Time)) + </div><div>  geom_bar(width = 1, stat = &quot;identity&quot;) +  xlab(&quot;&quot;) + ylab(&quot;&quot;) + ggtitle(&quot;Hits&quot;) + theme_bw() + </div><div>  geom_text(aes(y = val/2 + c(0, cumsum(val)[-length(val)]), label = Percentage), size=5) + coord_polar(theta = &quot;y&quot;)</div><div><br></div><div>Thank you so much! </div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-_dxcADZmIFs/UflmSUZZMdI/AAAAAAAAADQ/FF0PlzeVHZU/s1600/Rplot.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-_dxcADZmIFs/UflmSUZZMdI/AAAAAAAAADQ/FF0PlzeVHZU/s1600/Rplot.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792372384839000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2aAqgos_XEbuuFSCNU1fFi\"><img src=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-_dxcADZmIFs/UflmSUZZMdI/AAAAAAAAADQ/FF0PlzeVHZU/s320/Rplot.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"184\"></a></p><div><br></div><div><br></div></div>"
